WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.650
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.770
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:36.970
Ah... man, it's insanely hot out.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:40.470
Seriously, this heat is deadly.

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:44.980
I'm... done.

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:47.520
Koharu-chan!

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.020
Are you okay?!

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.230
I'm just a little dizzy...

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:53.030
Think it's heat exhaustion?

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:55.150
Let's take a little break.

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:00.490
I feel alive again!

00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:03.500
Thank goodness.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:04.870
Thank you.

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:06.790
Koharu, why don't you eat something?

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.420
You need to refuel.

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:11.170
I know, but I don't have an appetite.

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:12.590
Heya.

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:14.260
Yuzu-senpai!

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:16.630
Your tray's overflowing!

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:19.640
Are you going to eat all that yourself?

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:21.140
Of course!

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:23.930
Just looking at it makes me feel full.

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:26.850
You look pale. What happened?

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:28.650
Just a bout of heat exhaustion.

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:31.520
I know just the thing for you!

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:36.070
Here, check it out!

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:38.530
Burning Summer Dance Battle? {there's a reason I used burning and fortunately this is just a minor opinion thing}

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:44.660
Isn't this that famous dance competition held up on the plateau each summer?

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:46.000
The very same.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.710
Is it well known?

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:52.170
It's an event with pros participating that every dancer dreams of competing in.

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:57.180
It's the highest-profile contest in the nation, used to decide the summer's top dancer.

00:01:57.180 --> 00:01:58.760
Wow.

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:01.850
Yuzu-senpai, are you going to compete too?

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:03.060
You betcha!

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:05.890
I really want to see you dance!

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:10.810
It's probably cooler on the plateau too, so it'd help you recover from your heat exhaustion, Koharu.

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:13.320
Yeah, I'd love to go!

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:16.320
And needless to say, it's summer vacation.

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:20.070
Let's all go have some fun!

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:01.090
What a nice breeze.

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:02.840
It's a farm!

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:04.840
Cows.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.180
Horses!

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.600
Sheep!

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:10.600
Even ostriches!

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:12.600
It's a family!

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:14.100
They're so cute.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:17.360
Animals are great, but look up ahead. {you know I was trying to meme you fucker}

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.360
Burning Summer Dance Battle!

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:29.370
Looks like we're in for another summer of hot dance battles in every shape and form!

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.120
They're dancing!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:35.880
Their intensity gets me going!

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:37.590
They really are hot.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:39.460
Too hot...

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:42.050
Koharu-chan?

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:44.300
Hey!

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:46.800
Yuzu-senpai!

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.770
Yakisoba!

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:56.520
Cotton candy!

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:59.270
And soothing soft serve.

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.070
So rich!

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:03.070
It's cold and delicious!

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:06.280
Here, grilled corn-on-the-cob.{or just "grilled corn" like I think we did in charlotte}

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:07.820
It's piping hot!

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:09.120
And so sweet!

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:12.790
My personal favorite, cream soda. {it looks more like a melon soda ice cream float}

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:14.830
It's so fizzy!

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:18.290
The competition's specialty, tacos!

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:21.550
It's spicy, but I just can't stop!

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:23.710
Everything here is just too good!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.680
My heat exhaustion's been blown away.

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:27.050
I know, right?

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:31.350
I just remembered, Yuzu-senpai. 
Should you really be here with us?

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:33.060
What about the competition?

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:36.560
I already passed my prelims, so it's totally fine.

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:38.810
It is most certainly <i>not </i> fine.

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:44.190
Yuzu-sama, did I or did I not instruct you to stay put until the finals?

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:47.740
But how could I resist all the enticing smells?

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:49.700
No way I could stay in one place!

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:54.200
The other finalists are all championship caliber. You need to conserve your strength.

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.210
Um, I should apologize too.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:06:00.080
Yuzu-senpai was showing us around.

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.460
Nijino-san, what brings you here?

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.710
We wanted to see Yuzu-senpai dance.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.170
These two are my friends.

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:09.510
I'm Sakuraba Rola, from Song Class.

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:12.100
I'm Nanakura Koharu, from Beauty Class.

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:16.020
I am Katsura Miki, a third-year admin of Dance Class.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:19.600
Akashi Saya, also a second-year admin of Dance Class.

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:23.860
Mikki and Saaya are super reliable admins!

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:28.400
Your flattery is unnecessary.

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:29.780
Let's return at once.

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:32.120
You girls come along too!

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:33.240
Okay!

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:39.620
It's summer! Let's dance!

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:45.800
I'm Dance Class's teacher, Dave Satou!
Nice to meet you, woo! {I don't know}

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:48.220
Th-Thanks for the welcome.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:50.130
His movements are so sharp.

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:52.390
Dave-sensei, you worked up a real sweat.

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:54.970
Sweat is proof you're living life to its fullest!

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:57.980
And I'm living this summer with all I've got!

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:01.650
Yeah! Make sure you live a life of passion too, oh!

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:06.780
Dave-sensei's so sweaty and fiery that being around him makes you feel like you'll get heat stroke!

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:10.780
Nikaidou! Your words are honest and refreshing as always!

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:12.740
I love it! That's your individuality!

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:15.790
The final dancers of the prelims have taken the stage!

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:18.790
It's the Boney Boney Brothers!

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:30.630
Those two are incredible.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:31.970
They're perfectly in sync.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:34.680
This competition is quite high level.

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:38.350
That pair are pro dancers who travel the world.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:40.810
They're the number-one favorite.

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:46.940
Whoa! Votes for the Boney Boney Brothers are through the roof!

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:51.030
In this competition, the audience votes for the dancers they like,

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:53.950
and the top ten make it to the finals.

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:58.540
Votes decide who takes home the ultimate prize as well.

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:03.460
The winner earns the chance to study abroad in the mecca of dance, Los Angeles.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:06.960
Study abroad for dance? That gets me going!

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:13.220
It's the highest score yet!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:16.970
The Boney Boney Brothers clear the prelims at the top of the rankings!

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:19.850
You just need to place first in the finals, right?

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:21.730
Good luck, everyone!

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:24.730
The rest of us were all eliminated in the prelims.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.480
Yeah, yeah!

00:08:26.480 --> 00:08:28.770
Everyone was so high level!

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:33.240
Haruka failed too, and my excitement's down, down! {ep 16}

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:36.240
No, you seem pretty excited to me.

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:42.250
Everyone in Dance Class participated, 
but only Yuzu-sama was good enough to pass.

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:45.250
Yuzu-senpai, you're amazing... huh?

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:55.510
You've got a great view of the venue from here.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:58.760
But it's been so long! How've you been? {this is Lily, Yuzu's childhood friend and admin of song class}

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:05.270
They had these yummy-looking crêpes, and I thought of you right away.

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:06.520
Here.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.030
It's delicious!

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:23.410
See you later! Come back to the academy soon!

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:32.340
The Dance Battle finals will begin momentarily.{I would use "momentarily" but I wouldn't want to offend our British viewers}{I do}

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:36.130
We ask that all finalists now proceed backstage.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.010
Yuzu-senpai still isn't back.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:42.430
I wonder what happened.

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:48.310
Yuzu-sama's least favorite things are group activities and strict schedules.

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:51.820
She also has an otherworldly curiosity.

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:58.570
It's entirely possible for her to get distracted by 
something fun and lose track of time completely.

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:00.370
Does that happen a lot?

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.580
What if she doesn't make it in time?

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.330
Immediate disqualification!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.910
Bad!

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.710
Dance Class, assemble!

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:12.040
Ready!

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:15.970
This venue is abundant with things that could entice Yuzu-sama.

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:21.720
Our mission is to find her and bring her back in time for the finals.

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:24.720
Begin the Yuzu-sama capture plan!

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:26.230
Affirmative!

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:34.440
What's going on?

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:38.280
Yuzu-sama spotted!

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:41.990
She's juggling with a street performer!

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:43.990
Her bearing is south-southwest.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:48.500
Negative, she escaped!

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:57.760
Yuzu-sama spotted in the plaza!

00:10:58.220 --> 00:10:59.720
She's pursuing a butterfly.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.300
Her bearing is east-southeast.

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.340
Wait.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:03.760
Prepare it.

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:04.560
Roger.

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:10.020
Target locked.

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:11.440
Huh?! Wai—

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:12.020
Fire!

00:11:21.570 --> 00:11:23.870
Found a ladybug!

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:26.740
Even that didn't work.

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:28.080
We failed.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:29.330
Wow.

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:30.620
But how?

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:35.710
Nikaidou is the top student of Dance Class, 
with enough skill to join S4 in her second year.

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:40.130
She has instincts and reflexes rivaling that of wild beasts.

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:44.090
She cannot be caught with cheap tricks!

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:49.060
Huh? The ladybug disappeared.

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:51.350
I should probably be heading back now.

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:57.230
An ostrich?

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:01.900
Where did you come from?

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:04.450
Come on, over here.

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:13.210
It's okay. I won't hurt you.

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:20.590
Where's your home? Did you get lost?

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:24.760
Oh, you got separated from your mom.

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:27.850
I'll help you look for her!

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:31.180
The wait is over.

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:35.100
The finals of the Burning Summer Dance Battle start now!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.610
We need a new plan.

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:39.690
They've started.

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:41.110
Yuzu-senpai...

00:12:41.690 --> 00:12:43.530
Where did you go?{kikoooeruuu kaa naaaa}

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:58.290
That was the Boney Boney Brothers, 
with another spectacular performance!

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:03.340
What do the voters think?

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:07.850
They jumped right into first place!

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:10.850
Have we not retrieved Yuzu-sama yet?{she sees kinda like kirino out}

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:14.600
There were no traces of her in the south and east blocks.

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:16.600
We should help look too!

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:21.860
If the Dance Class girls still can't find her in the venue, she might've gone outside.

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:23.690
In that case...

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:27.870
I think I remember this road.

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:32.410
Considering how curious Yuzu-senpai is, the animals might've caught her eye.

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:33.620
Look, it's her!

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:35.620
Yuzu-senpai!

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:39.080
I'm so glad you're back with your mom again.

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:41.130
Yuzu-senpai!

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:43.710
What are you doing here?

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:47.050
I found a lost ostrich, so I helped it back here.

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:48.970
The finals have already started!

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:51.140
You don't need to tell me that.

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:55.890
But if I abandoned someone in distress, I wouldn't be able to enjoy dancing.{kid is really only for humans and goats and other words don't really}{I... suppose that's true}

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:58.150
Yuzu-senpai...

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.400
But now that I'm done...

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:01.860
Let's dash!

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:07.150
She's fast!

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.870
We're nearing the end of the show.

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:13.660
Let's blitz on through to the very end!

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.660
It's Yuzu-sama's turn next.

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:26.920
Yuzu-senpai!

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:32.180
Are you the mommy ostrich?

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:36.020
You'll give me a ride? Thanks!

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:40.350
Onward ho!

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:47.820
Girls, I'm back!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:49.320
Yoohoo!

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:51.320
A-An ostrich?!

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:52.200
And down.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:53.870
Thank you.

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:59.120
I love it, Nikaidou! Making a gallant appearance on an ostrich!

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:01.460
What an utterly unpredictable performance!

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:05.130
Nikaidou, you're the best!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:08.590
You even blew Haruka's eyes wide open!

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:10.470
Surprise, surprise!

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:12.220
Yay!

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:15.810
Yuzu-sama, I have more than a few choice words for you, but that can come later!

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:16.970
Hurry and get ready!

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:17.850
Sure!

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:21.730
These are the cards we have for you.

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:24.480
The Tropical Hula Girl Coord.

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:30.450
It has a skirt with tropical hues and is decked liberally with flowers.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:35.240
I believe that it is a dress exemplifying both summer and you.{I am the change I will to see in the world}

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:38.830
If you say so, then it must be true.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:43.130
Mikki, Saaya, thanks. I love you!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:44.590
Th-Thank you.

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:48.130
Don't think saying that will get you off the hook.

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:50.010
I was just saying how I feel!

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:53.010
Now go on standby.

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:54.760
Okay!

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.810
Yuzu-senpai!

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:07.820
Girls!

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:09.360
Please do your best!

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:11.190
Thanks, I will.

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:13.610
Sorry about the trouble I caused.

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:14.910
It was nothing.

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:18.830
Excuse me, but aren't you nervous, Yuzu-senpai?

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:21.330
This is such a huge competition.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:22.710
Nervous?

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.460
Of course I am.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:28.710
Every one of my rivals is top class.

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:34.180
The other girls in Dance Class didn't make it,
so all their hopes lie with me.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:37.220
It's a lot to shoulder, really.

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:39.220
Yuzu-senpai...

00:16:39.220 --> 00:16:42.850
But dancing is supposed to be fun.

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:49.230
The nerves and pressure, the excitement and anticipation, I'll mix it all together and just have fun out there!

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:54.740
Next is the super idol from S4, Nikaidou Yuzu-san!

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:57.620
Fun is the best!

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:01.430
Thanks for waiting!

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:00.720
Thank you!

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:02.720
Yay!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.930
A job well done, Katsura-senpai.

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:11.310
It was a rough ride.

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.600
You're telling me.

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:17.480
Yuzu-sama is loose and unbound, always running us ragged.

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:22.990
But whenever I see her dance, 
any hardships just seem to fly away.

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:27.240
Even though she's younger than me, and even though we're rivals,

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:32.250
I can't help but want to do everything in my power to let her dance to her heart's desire.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.040
Thank you! {deliberate three liner}

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:35.250
And there's nothing we can do about it.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:36.790
You said it.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:44.260
It's time to crown the top dancer at this year's Burning Summer Dance Battle.

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.760
The winner by a landslide...

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:50.270
From S4, Nikaidou Yuzu-san!

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:52.390
Yay!

00:20:57.770 --> 00:21:00.030
Now, a short interview with the winner.

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:03.740
Nikaidou Yuzu-san, congratulations on your victory.

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:08.160
Everyone, thanks so much for voting for me!

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:12.660
You've also secured a trip to Los Angeles. How do you feel right now?

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:14.920
Huh? Why Los Angeles?

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:20.170
The winner gets the chance to study dance abroad in Los Angeles.

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:23.590
Oh, I think I remember hearing about that.

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:25.930
I'll pass!

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:26.930
Huh?

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:31.930
It's too much fun dancing with S4 and Dance Class!

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:34.430
What a girl.

00:21:34.430 --> 00:21:36.980
I'll give the Los Angeles thing to Haruka.

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:38.690
Huh? I can have it?!

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:40.440
It's yours! {or we can reorganize the past line but...}

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:45.700
Lucky! Haruka's going to Los Angeles! Go, go!{so did they just decide to ship her out of the show because people don't like her? I thought people liked her}

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:46.610
Go, go!

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:50.370
Yuzu-senpai is way too free.

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:54.200
Hey, everyone! Don't you feel a little empty just watching us?

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:55.750
Aren't your bodies raring to go?

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:58.500
Mine's chomping at the bit! {you're out of your fucking mind}

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:01.500
Seeing everyone dance has gotten me hyped!

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:04.510
I wanna dance even more!

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:09.510
I want to dance together with you all! Let's dancing!

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:25.030
Fun really is the best!

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:06.040
August Marina is a really fun stage filled with fishies and juice.

00:24:06.040 --> 00:24:09.090
Snap a shot of the greatest happy smile!

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:12.220
Look! Up in the sky!

00:24:12.220 --> 00:24:13.260
It's a bird.

00:24:13.260 --> 00:24:14.550
It's a plane!

00:24:14.550 --> 00:24:16.680
No, it's Body Bird! {help, is this right?}{correct enough for me}

00:24:16.680 --> 00:24:18.430
Body Bird?

00:24:18.430 --> 00:24:20.810
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.810 --> 00:24:21.980
Passion and Pride.

00:24:21.980 --> 00:24:24.520
Become the first-star idol!
